---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import fish from "../../data/fish.json";

import Related from "../../components/Related.astro";
const tuna = fish
  .filter((f) => (f.title || "").toLowerCase().includes("tuna"))
  .sort((a, b) => Number(a.rank || 99) - Number(b.rank || 99));

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  headline: "Tuna Party & Salvage Drone Unlock Guide",
  description: "How the Tuna Party works in Dave the Diver and how Cobra unlocks the Salvage Drone.",
  datePublished: "2026-08-20",
  dateModified: "2026-08-20",
  author: { "@type": "Organization", name: "DiverDB" },
};
---

<Base
  title="Tuna Party & Salvage Drone Unlock - Dave the Diver - DiverDB"
  description="Tuna Party event guide for Dave the Diver, including the Salvage Drone unlock and tuna recipes."
  schema={articleSchema}
>
  <h1>Tuna Party &amp; Salvage Drone Unlock</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Tuna becomes available after the seasonal Tuna Party, which also gives you access to the Salvage Drone.
  </p>

  <h2>How the event unlocks</h2>
  <p>
    Seasonal events are calendar-driven and appear after the Jellyfish Party around October 12.
    The Tuna Party arrives through the Mail app after the Jellyfish Party. Cobra gives access to the
    Salvage Drone, which is useful for transporting large fish like tuna.
  </p>
  <p>
    The event marks qualifying dishes with a pink bow tie icon. Stock tuna ingredients before the
    party and save the right recipes so the menu can run through the event night.
  </p>

  <h2>Tuna species in the database</h2>
  <div style="overflow-x:auto">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Fish</th>
          <th>Rank</th>
          <th>Weight</th>
          <th>Meat / day</th>
          <th>Recipes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {tuna.map((f) => (
          <tr>
            <td><strong>{f.title}</strong></td>
            <td>{f.rank || "—"}</td>
            <td>{f.weight || "—"}</td>
            <td>{f.meat_per_day || "—"}</td>
            <td>{f.recipes || "—"}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>After the party</h2>
  <p>
    Cobra's shop can sell the Steel Net Sensor Trap once the Tuna Party is announced. Net weapons and
    the drone make tuna farming much easier, so upgrade the drone and net gun before the next event.
  </p>

  <Related
    heading="Next steps"
    links={[
    { href: "/rankings/", title: "Rankings", sub: "Best fish, dishes, staff and weapons ranked", tool: true },
    { href: "/tools/", title: "Tools", sub: "Planner, filter and compare utilities", tool: true },
  ]}
  />
</Base>
